rows.en:
The club room door shut...
My body crumpled to the floor.
After that, nothing moved ever again..........{p}

Oh, what the heck, I'll go.
He's really eccentric, but...
he seems to know lots of unusual stories.{p}

"Right. On the land where they're building the second gym, there used to be an old school building.
It was torn down two summers ago.
The old school building was a place with tons of supernatural phenomena..."{p}

"Look, there's this one, too."
"Ahaha.
That's hilarious."{p}
